### 8.1 Zone of awareness

- Complete set of locations and objects within the zone.
- Limited by line of sight; occluded objects inferred via ghost mapping if previously seen in-zone with LoS and ghost has not left the zone.
- Stub: capsule/corridor sweep reliability varies by attributes/skills once skill feature lands.
